<pb facs="1038363" n="141r"/>
    <lb/><opener>Eidem.</opener>
  <p><lb/>Credebam <add>e</add>quidem, me hac die, ut nuper Tibi p<subst><del>r<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></del><add>er</add></subst><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>scripsi, iter ad Paternos Lares visitand<subst><del>is</del><add><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></add></subst> instituturum esse;
      <lb/>sed quia a<subst><del>d<gap/></del><add>b</add> </subst><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> <abbr>Dn.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Secretario <rs key="pers_DE-588-1222289342" type="person">Gadaldini</rs>, ad quem veni<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>causa per ipsius <abbr>Dni</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1222289342" type="person">Secretarii</rs> <rs type="person">filium</rs> Monachum <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-1086701992">Div<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>Justin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <rs type="lostletter">scribi</rs><note type="comment">Nicolaus I liess den Sekretär Agostino Gadaldini durch dessen Sohn, einen Mönch von Santa Giustina, schriftlich um Erlaubnis zur Abreise bitten. Das Gesuch ist bislang nur durch diese Erwähnung belegt. Im <ref target="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/bau/content/zoom/4296209">Reisebüchlein</ref> (p. 28) verzeichnet Nicolaus für den 8. Juni ein weiteres Schreiben an Gadaldini in derselben Angelegenheit.</note> feci, responsionem<note type="comment">Am 3. Juni wartete Nicolaus I noch auf eine Antwort. Im <ref target="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/bau/content/zoom/4296209">Reisebüchlein</ref> (p. 28) vermerkt er, dass er die Erlaubnis am 15. Juni dem Capitano vorlegte.</note> nondum accepi, ut et pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pter alia impedimenta distuli abitum meum. Quocirca
      <lb/>cum<del> <gap/></del> <subst><del>demum post</del><add>vix ante</add></subst> festum Divi Antonii hinc profe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><pb facs="1038364" n="141v"/><lb break="no"/>cturus sim <add>poteris interim</add>, si Tibi lubeat<supplied>,</supplied><del> interim</del> <subst><del>aliqua mandare</del><add>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> voles <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me exequenda</add></subst>, <del>habebis</del>
      <lb/><subst><del>me</del><add>mihi significare queam</add></subst> voluntati tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> obsequentissimum <del><gap/></del><add>habebis</add>.</p> <closer>Vale.</closer><dateline><date when="1717-06-03">3. Juni<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></date>.</dateline>
</div></body></text></TEI>